  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palabana Dairy Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will strengthen the financial and operational capacity of the cooperative. The cooperative will be provided with a chilling tank to increase its negotiating power with off-takers. Farmers will be supported with training and materials in best dairy husbandry practices. Access to working capital for inputs.</narrative>
  </description>
